      "title_en": "Foxy's dream",
      "title_ru": "Сон Фокси",
      "body_en": "Foxy was tired yesterday. His dream was very interesting. In his dream he got a balloon and a card. He was not scared in the dream. He has got a wish: a delicious mango for dessert!",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "sp4.m5.t1.q1",
          "kind": "choice",
          "q_en": "How was Foxy yesterday?",
          "q_ru": "Каким Фокси был вчера?",
          "options": [
            "Tired",
            "Angry",
            "Scared"
          ],
          "answer": "Tired"
        },
        {
          "id": "sp4.m5.t1.q2",
